== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Solar System}}.
* This item is a reference<ref>Isaac lore stream https://youtu.be/kby0rXT7qYQ?t=1454</ref> to [[wikipedia:Halo of Flies (song)|Halo of Flies]], by Alice Cooper.
* Halo of Flies was the first [[Familiar#Orbital Familiars|orbital]] item that Edmund McMillen ever implemented into The Binding of Isaac.
* Halo of Flies shares its name with a level from Edmund's previous game [[wikipedia:Super Meat Boy|Super Meat Boy]].

